@startuml CU-31
actor "Cliente" as Cli
boundary "«UI» Angular (Chat)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /ai/chat" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» AIService / Ollama" as Model

Cli -> UI : 1: Escribe mensaje en chat
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /api/v1/ai/chat {message, context, history}
Ctrl -> Model : 3: chat_with_context(message, context, history)
Model -> Model : 4: Construir prompt (system + context + history + user)
Model -> Model : 5: Ollama.chat(messages, temperature, max_tokens)
Model --> Ctrl : 5: {message, model, tokens}
Ctrl --> UI : 6: AIChatResponse
UI --> Cli : 7: Respuesta del asistente

@enduml